WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.615
To‘lqin, issiqlik va Laplas tenglamalari juda boshqacha yechimlarga ega.

2
00:00:06.615 --> 00:00:07.075
Nega?

3
00:00:07.075 --> 00:00:12.771
Javob ikkinchi tartibli hosilalar oldidagi koeffitsiyentlarda.

4
00:00:12.771 --> 00:00:21.132
Bu qismda tenglamani qanday yozishni, diskriminantni hisoblashni va uch turni — giperbolik,

5
00:00:21.132 --> 00:00:25.358
parabolik va elliptikni ajratishni o‘rganamiz.

6
00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:34.076
Muhim kelishuv: biz tenglamani a u x x qo‘shuv ikki b u x y qo‘shuv c u y y deb yozamiz.

7
00:00:34.076 --> 00:00:37.348
Aralash had oldida ikki b turibdi.

8
00:00:37.348 --> 00:00:40.716
Diskriminant: b kvadrat ayiruv a c.

9
00:00:40.716 --> 00:00:47.355
Ba’zi kitoblarda ikki yo‘q va b kvadrat ayiruv to‘rt a c ishlatiladi.

10
00:00:47.355 --> 00:00:51.974
Ishora bir xil, lekin yozuvlarni aralashtirmang!

11
00:00:52.224 --> 00:00:59.735
Diskriminant musbat bo‘lsa, tenglama giperbolik, namunasi to‘lqin tenglamasi.

12
00:00:59.735 --> 00:01:04.808
Nol bo‘lsa, parabolik, namunasi issiqlik tenglamasi.

13
00:01:04.808 --> 00:01:09.881
Manfiy bo‘lsa, elliptik, namunasi Laplas tenglamasi.

14
00:01:09.881 --> 00:01:17.587
Bu ikkinchi tartibli egri chiziqlar: giperbola, parabola va ellipsga o‘xshaydi.

15
00:01:17.587 --> 00:01:21.782
Quyi tartibli hadlar turga ta’sir qilmaydi.

16
00:01:22.032 --> 00:01:28.572
Misol: u x x qo‘shuv ikki u x y qo‘shuv ikki u y y teng nol.

17
00:01:28.572 --> 00:01:36.638
Aralash had koeffitsiyenti ikki, demak ikki b teng ikki, ya’ni b teng bir.

18
00:01:36.638 --> 00:01:39.254
a teng bir, c teng ikki.

19
00:01:39.504 --> 00:01:44.140
Diskriminant: bir ayiruv ikki, teng minus bir.

20
00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:47.365
Manfiy, demak tenglama elliptik.

21
00:01:47.365 --> 00:01:58.249
Agar xato qilib b ni ikki desangiz, to‘rt ayiruv ikki musbat chiqadi va noto‘g‘ri “giperbolik” javob olasiz.

22
00:01:58.249 --> 00:02:04.598
Shuning uchun har doim aralash koeffitsiyentning yarmini oling.

23
00:02:04.848 --> 00:02:10.755
Koeffitsiyentlar o‘zgaruvchan bo‘lsa, tur sohaga bog‘liq.

24
00:02:10.755 --> 00:02:16.663
Trikomi tenglamasi: y karra u x x qo‘shuv u y y teng nol.

25
00:02:16.663 --> 00:02:18.839
Diskriminant minus y.

26
00:02:18.839 --> 00:02:30.136
Grafikda chiziq y teng nol: undan yuqorida tenglama elliptik, pastda giperbolik, chiziqning o‘zida parabolik.

27
00:02:30.136 --> 00:02:35.318
Bu tovushdan tez va sekin gaz oqimining chegarasi.

28
00:02:35.568 --> 00:02:42.456
O‘zingizni tekshiring: ekrandagi tenglamada b nimaga teng va tenglama qaysi turga tegishli?

29
00:02:42.456 --> 00:02:46.694
Avval aralash koeffitsiyentni ikkiga bo‘lishni unutmang.
